    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνυπο-κρίνομαι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accommodate oneself by pretending</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.31.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνυπεκρίθη τίθεσθαι φιλίαν πρὸς
					αὐτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.52.6
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὸ προσποίημα τῷ Μαρίῳ</span>
			<i>helping</i> M. <i>to maintain his pretence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνυπεκρίνετο τοῖς προθύμως . .
				διακειμένοις</span>
			<i>pretended to agree with</i> the eager spirits, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.92.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
